**/google-services.json
# ...except the two example configs, which belong to a Firebase project
# created solely to be public. Client configuration ships inside every
# APK; the service account that can actually send a notification is not
# here. Without these, no example can send or receive a push, which is
# the gap every Android defect this project shipped went through.
!examples/android/app/google-services.json
!examples/flutter/android/app/google-services.json
**/*service-account*.json
